[node name="AreaLight3D" type="AreaLight3D" parent="." unique_id=372287465]
editor_description = "Baked into this ceiling's lightmap (bake mode Static) and hidden in game, so it costs nothing at runtime.
Godot 4.7.1 bakes area lights about 2.2x brighter than it draws them live: this energy (1.89) bakes to the live look of the old 4.118.
Range 2.72 m stops the glow at this ceiling's edges, so ceilings that face different ways meet without seams.
After changing it, select LightmapGI and press Bake Lightmaps."
